  "deprecated": false,
  "description_en": "Queries the list of schemas under a specified database or MaxCompute project in Data Map. Currently supports MaxCompute and Holo types",
  "description_zh": "查询数据地图中给定数据库或maxcompute项目下的模式列表，当前支持maxcompute和holo类型",
  "kebab_example": "aliyun dataworks-public list-schemas --parent-meta-entity-id maxcompute-project:::project_name --api-version 2024-05-18 --region cn-hangzhou",
  "method": "GET",
  "multi_version": true,
  "name": "ListSchemas",
  "operation": {
    "action": "ListSchemas",
    "api_style": "RPC",
    "api_version": "2024-05-18",
    "method": "GET",
    "operation_type": "read",
    "protocol": "HTTPS",
    "system_operation_type": "list",
    "url": ""
  },
  "parameters": [
    {
      "example": "maxcompute-project:::project_name",
      "help_en": "The parent entity ID. For more information, see https://help.aliyun.com/document_detail/2880092.html. For the Hologres metadata crawler type, you can call the ListDatabases operation to query the settings of the `ParentMetaEntityId` parameter.\n\nConfigure the `ParentMetaEntityId` parameter in the `${EntityType}:${Instance ID or escaped URL}:${Catalog identifier}:${Database name}` format. If a level does not exist, leave the level empty.\n\nIf you want to query the information about a MaxCompute schema, specify an empty string at the Instance ID level as a placeholder and a MaxCompute project name at the Database name level. Make sure that the schema feature is enabled for the MaxCompute project",
      "help_zh": "父层级实体ID，可参考https://help.aliyun.com/document_detail/2880092.html，其中holo类型的0可参考ListDatabases接口返回结果。\n\n`ParentMetaEntityId`格式为`${EntityType}:${实例ID或转义后的URL}:${数据目录标识}:${数据库名称}`，对于不存在的层级空字符占位。\n\n对于maxcompute类型，实例id层级使用空字符占位，数据库名称为maxcompute项目名称，要求该项目已开启三层模型。\n\n几种常用类型ParentMetaEntityId格式参考如下\n\n`maxcompute-project:::project_name` （要求该项目已开启三层模型）\n\n`holo-database:instance_id::database_name`\n\n其中   \n`instance_id`: holo实例ID   \n`database_name`: 数据库名称   \n`project_name`: maxcompute项目名",
      "location": "query",
      "name": "parent_meta_entity_id",
      "options": [
        "--parent-meta-entity-id"
      ],
      "raw_name": "ParentMetaEntityId",
      "required": true,
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "example": "abc",
      "help_en": "The name. Fuzzy match is supported",
      "help_zh": "名称，模糊匹配",
      "location": "query",
      "name": "name",
      "options": [
        "--name"
      ],
      "raw_name": "Name",
      "required": false,
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "example": "test comment",
      "help_en": "The comment. Fuzzy match is supported",
      "help_zh": "注释，模糊匹配",
      "location": "query",
      "name": "comment",
      "options": [
        "--comment"
      ],
      "raw_name": "Comment",
      "required": false,
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "element": {
        "type": "string"
      },
      "help_en": "The types. Exact match is supported. If this parameter is left empty, all types are queried",
      "help_zh": "类型，精确匹配，为空时查询所有类型",
      "location": "query",
      "name": "types",
      "options": [
        "--types"
      ],
      "param_style": "simple",
      "raw_name": "Types",
      "required": false,
      "type": "array"
    },
    {
      "enum": [
        "CreateTime",
        "ModifyTime",
        "Name",
        "Type"
      ],
      "example": "CreateTime",
      "help_en": "The field used for sorting. Default value: CreateTime. Valid values:\n\nCreateTime\n\nModifyTime\n\nName\n\nType",
      "help_zh": "排序字段，默认为CreateTime，枚举值，当前支持：\n\nCreateTime：创建时间。\nModifyTime：修改时间。\nName：名称。\nType：类型",
      "location": "query",
      "name": "sort_by",
      "options": [
        "--sort-by"
      ],
      "pattern": "^[\\w.,;/@-]+$",
      "raw_name": "SortBy",
      "required": false,
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "enum": [
        "Asc",
        "Desc"
      ],
      "example": "Asc",
      "help_en": "The order in which schemas are sorted. Default value: Asc. Valid values:\n\nAsc: ascending order\n\nDesc: descending order",
      "help_zh": "排序方向，默认为Asc，枚举值，当前支持：\n\nAsc：升序。\nDesc：降序",
      "location": "query",
      "name": "order",
      "options": [
        "--order"
      ],
      "raw_name": "Order",
      "required": false,
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "example": "1",
